From 1ea23a6af245c3ec56b5735c6f99f68f76de2bff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZhangDM-520 <jixianqiang1540@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:36:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] fix(color): address the external review round

Memory safety: close the icc_file memfd after marshalling (libwayland dups;
64-request storm leaked 64 fds before), release the LUT fold inputs exactly
once on allocation failure, and bound per-client ICC memory (32 MB outstanding
bytes, 4 concurrent creators).

Colorimetry: derive the panel white as the colorant sum in one frame (chad or
explicit Bradford, no double adaptation), make sdr_gamut=srgb white-preserving
(source white lands on panel white; native<->srgb never changes white), bake
encode curves on a quadratic grid with a named gamma-2.2 stage and residual
LUT (gamma 2.4 shadow error 7.9 -> 0.25 of an 8-bit code), enforce monotone
TRC inversion, reject degenerate primaries, refit power curves minimax in
linear light, and structurally validate untrusted ICC bytes (mutation-fuzzed
20k).

Config: re-read an edited profile on reload (mtime in the rule, profile files
join the watcher, EDID fingerprint in the cache key), align load/apply
fallback down the chain to EDID (apply read authoritative), reject
non-regular profile files without blocking, reserve the edid keyword,
document and test path rules, and gate both lcms2 lookups behind one -Dlcms2
(the no-lcms2 build compiles clean and skips the ICC cases).

Protocol: set_icc_file now refuses non-regular fds with bad_fd (a directory fd
lseeks fine but cannot be read; the request contract demands a seekable,
readable regular file).

Tests/harness: bound the mapped-pixel band to the measured result (a blank
frame no longer passes), derive the sample point from the output size, trap
teardown for the FIFO client, round-trip the fixture primaries from the
generator (spec-correct colorants summing to the declared white) instead of
re-asserting unit constants, direct pins for surfaceTransferLabel, live pins
for the fd + budget caps and the bad_fd gate (protocol/color_profile_limits,
protocol/color_profile).

Comment hygiene per CONTRIBUTING: no history narration.

Validated: full meson 144 OK / 0 fail; harness color 9/9 and render 31/31
apart from the known environmental title_bar_blur_refocus; clang-format,
remark, diff-check clean; -Dlcms2=disabled builds. Red-first and mutation
probes captured for every new check.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
